WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:30.640 --> 01:34.560
Wow, Vanilla was growing raspberries.

01:34.560 --> 01:37.270
I just never noticed them before.

01:37.270 --> 01:40.020
And you came to eat them, didn't you?

01:42.940 --> 01:46.650
Is Vanilla ever coming home?

01:46.660 --> 01:50.530
If only I could do something
about Vanilla's Noir heart.

01:50.530 --> 01:52.450
Oh yeah!

01:52.450 --> 01:56.960
Maybe I won't be able to take Vanilla's Noir heart, just like I couldn't take Takamura's.

02:01.170 --> 02:02.880
Aren't you forgetting
something, Chocolat?

02:03.380 --> 02:04.510
Robin!

02:04.510 --> 02:08.050
Unlike humans,
mages have only one heart.

02:08.550 --> 02:10.560
Guess what happens
if you yank it out.

02:11.140 --> 02:12.930
That's right.

02:12.930 --> 02:15.570
Vanilla would die
if she lost her heart.

02:15.570 --> 02:18.440
Don't underestimate
the Ogres, Chocolat.

02:18.440 --> 02:21.540
Houx and Saule, you two should
focus on guarding Chocolat,

02:21.540 --> 02:23.580
and let the adults handle the Ogres.

02:24.490 --> 02:27.070
Why should we
"let the adults handle it"?

02:27.070 --> 02:28.580
All right!

02:28.580 --> 02:32.340
I'll take care of these raspberries
while Vanilla's away!

02:32.790 --> 02:34.300
Chocolat...

02:36.040 --> 02:39.100
Showdown with Vanilla! The Secret Spice.

02:41.800 --> 02:44.180
This is very unlike you, Chocolat.

02:44.720 --> 02:47.890
Vanilla took very good care
of these things.

02:47.890 --> 02:49.350
I seem to remember an incident,

02:49.350 --> 02:54.150
when you completely ruined Gramps'
Bonsai tree by casting a spell on it.

02:56.360 --> 02:59.770
You're really worried about
Vanilla, aren't you?

02:59.770 --> 03:00.520
Yeah.

03:00.520 --> 03:02.840
That's because she's in love.

03:03.900 --> 03:08.570
Women turn soft
when there's a guy they like.

03:09.490 --> 03:14.290
Much like this flower,
they become sweeter and weaker.

03:16.120 --> 03:18.380
I am NOT in love!

03:18.380 --> 03:20.630
And just what have you been up to?

03:21.040 --> 03:22.630
Oh, nothing at all.

03:22.630 --> 03:26.380
I'm just here for Houx's
legendary chocolate croissants.

03:26.380 --> 03:27.840
Make me one, Houx.

03:27.840 --> 03:28.800
I can't.

03:28.800 --> 03:29.930
Make one anyway.

03:29.930 --> 03:31.680
It is impossible.

03:31.680 --> 03:33.930
You have such cute lips.

03:33.930 --> 03:37.390
I'm getting a sudden urge...
to go bake some croissants!

03:37.390 --> 03:40.570
I'll make them, please let
me make them for you!

03:41.440 --> 03:44.600
Now that I take a closer look at you,
you're very adorable, Houx.

03:45.190 --> 03:47.540
They turn soft when in love...

03:47.540 --> 03:48.570
and become weaker.

03:51.530 --> 03:52.950
No, I can't!

03:52.950 --> 03:55.840
I've got to deal with Vanilla
and the Queen Exam!

03:56.540 --> 04:00.330
I can't let myself think about Pierre.

04:01.790 --> 04:05.800
Will these books tell me how
to return Vanilla to normal...

04:05.800 --> 04:07.300
without removing her black heart?

04:07.300 --> 04:09.810
You won't find that
in any books of sorcery!

04:10.300 --> 04:13.010
Lately you're taking care of
plants, reading books...

04:13.010 --> 04:15.890
in short, nothing
that reels in the ecure!

04:16.890 --> 04:20.070
Of course! This is a job for
the Fortune-Telling Book!

04:21.480 --> 04:23.900
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

04:25.190 --> 04:28.450
Divination Livre!

04:29.740 --> 04:33.580
Tell me a way to save Vanilla!

04:39.370 --> 04:41.380
The Vacillating Heart.

04:41.380 --> 04:44.130
This card means that it's most
important to think about...

04:44.130 --> 04:45.420
what you can do for that person,

04:45.420 --> 04:48.010
even if you do not receive an answer.

04:48.010 --> 04:50.890
Your thoughts will surely reach them.

04:52.540 --> 04:55.890
That's what you call
"Fortune-not-Telling."

04:58.100 --> 05:02.270
Vanilla has fallen into the hands of
the Ogres while in my custody.

05:02.270 --> 05:03.820
I deeply apologize for this.

05:03.820 --> 05:05.280
There was no helping it.

05:05.820 --> 05:09.530
So does this mean Vanilla will
lose her Queen candidacy?

05:09.530 --> 05:13.200
No, the Queen Selection Exam
will continue as scheduled.

05:13.200 --> 05:15.250
However, Noir hearts
will not be counted.

05:15.660 --> 05:17.660
When it comes to matters
concerning the Queen,

05:17.660 --> 05:21.000
the decisions of the Senate
cannot be overturned.

05:21.000 --> 05:26.380
This holds true whether Vanilla
or Chocolat ascends the throne.

05:26.380 --> 05:28.110
This, too, is one of Vanilla's trials.

05:29.130 --> 05:31.340
That is how I view the situation.

05:42.730 --> 05:45.780
Chocolat, what are you doing here?

05:45.780 --> 05:48.570
I was thinking Vanilla would be thrilled...

05:48.570 --> 05:54.000
that the raspberries she'd
nurtured had borne fruit.

05:54.580 --> 05:57.370
But, do you really
think those feelings...

05:57.370 --> 06:00.330
will reach Vanilla
through her black heart?

06:02.500 --> 06:03.880
I don't get it.

06:03.880 --> 06:07.340
But the card from the
Fortune-Telling Book said...

06:07.340 --> 06:09.220
that if no answer comes,

06:09.220 --> 06:12.800
I have to think about what
I can do for that person.

06:18.270 --> 06:19.770
There.

06:19.770 --> 06:21.310
Chocolat...

06:21.770 --> 06:23.690
Here, take this.

06:23.690 --> 06:24.940
What is it?

06:24.940 --> 06:26.690
There's a bunch of croissants in there.

06:26.690 --> 06:28.000
Eat them at lunch.

06:28.530 --> 06:31.490
It's best not to obsess
over Vanilla too much.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.750
Thank you, Houx!

06:38.960 --> 06:41.290
Good morning...

07:10.280 --> 07:13.080
This concludes the morning classes.

07:26.800 --> 07:27.800
Here goes!

07:28.920 --> 07:30.300
Vanilla!

07:31.840 --> 07:33.140
What is it?

07:33.140 --> 07:34.890
What, I can't talk to you?

07:37.970 --> 07:38.770
Wait up!

07:41.810 --> 07:44.560
It's been so long
since I faced Vanilla like this.

07:44.560 --> 07:49.240
I'm so happy and there's so
much I want to say to her.

07:49.240 --> 07:51.070
But the words won't come out right.

07:52.110 --> 07:53.780
If you have nothing to say,
then I'm leaving.

07:57.700 --> 07:58.790
Here.

08:00.540 --> 08:03.000
They're berries from the raspberry
plants you were growing.

08:04.170 --> 08:08.380
The birds come to the garden every
morning and try to eat them.

08:09.760 --> 08:11.430
It's strange, isn't it?

08:11.430 --> 08:14.090
You used to wake me up
every morning,

08:14.090 --> 08:18.850
but now it's the birds that come
to eat your raspberries.

08:18.850 --> 08:22.690
It's almost like you sent them
to me as a present,

08:22.690 --> 08:24.780
to keep me from over-sleeping.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.110
You're an idiot.

08:28.190 --> 08:30.990
Trust me, that's not the case.

08:30.990 --> 08:32.530
Yeah, I guess not.

08:32.530 --> 08:34.820
Don't concern yourself with me.

08:34.820 --> 08:38.370
And don't act so
chummy with me, either!

08:38.370 --> 08:39.410
Vanilla!

08:46.840 --> 08:50.340
It's so hard to get
your feelings across...

08:52.760 --> 08:56.590
Houx made this lunch for me.

08:58.390 --> 09:00.470
It's delicious...

09:01.560 --> 09:05.600
It's best not to obsess
over Vanilla too much.

09:06.520 --> 09:11.570
Eating this tenderly-made food
makes my heart feel lighter.

09:12.280 --> 09:13.530
Whoa, amazing!

09:14.240 --> 09:16.200
Is this all your lunch, Chocolat?

09:16.200 --> 09:17.870
It's sooo fancy!

09:17.870 --> 09:20.330
It's croissant sandwiches
and custard pie.

09:20.330 --> 09:22.620
There's enough for everybody,
so dig in!

09:22.620 --> 09:24.010
Ahhhh~ I'll eat it!

09:24.010 --> 09:25.750
They all look so good~

09:25.750 --> 09:28.300
That's because of all the butter!

09:28.300 --> 09:29.170
All the...

09:29.170 --> 09:30.250
butter?

09:30.630 --> 09:32.680
What's come over you?

09:32.680 --> 09:33.760
Lost your appetite?

09:33.760 --> 09:35.930
I'm on diet...

09:35.930 --> 09:36.760
Me too...

09:36.760 --> 09:37.310
Yeah...

09:37.310 --> 09:40.600
I see. Then I'll have to eat it all!

09:40.600 --> 09:42.770
Wait a minute, I might have some!

09:42.770 --> 09:44.480
It really does look good!

09:44.480 --> 09:46.650
But it'll make us fat...

09:46.650 --> 09:49.030
Ahhhhh~ But I want to eat it!

09:49.030 --> 09:51.820
Attention, all you
health-conscious young ladies...

09:51.820 --> 09:57.080
I have brought this spice specifically
for young ladies like yourselves.

09:57.080 --> 09:58.280
Ehh?

09:58.280 --> 10:01.810
It's a powerful ally of those
who aspire to be thin:

10:01.810 --> 10:04.000
Everything Zero Spice!

10:04.000 --> 10:06.960
Any dish you add this to
will have Zero Calories!

10:07.380 --> 10:11.300
And to aid weight loss,
adding more will make you thinner!

10:11.300 --> 10:13.550
Oh!? Really?!

10:13.670 --> 10:15.420
It's delectable, as well!

10:23.640 --> 10:26.270
No, don't add it!

10:26.610 --> 10:28.400
If it's zero-cal, it's okay.

10:28.860 --> 10:29.650
I want some, too!

10:30.190 --> 10:31.270
Pour it on, pour it on!

10:31.610 --> 10:33.770
Very well! It comes in all flavors.

10:33.770 --> 10:36.780
and draws out ten times the normal
taste of the main dish!

10:40.290 --> 10:43.280
Now I don't have to resist
eating Curry Doria anymore!

10:43.280 --> 10:44.540
Me neither!

10:44.540 --> 10:47.290
With this, I can eat
my fill of anything I want!

10:49.500 --> 10:51.670
Tasty~

10:51.670 --> 10:52.920
Buono!

10:52.920 --> 10:54.500
Delicious!

10:55.380 --> 10:58.180
It makes everything zero-cal?

10:58.180 --> 11:00.470
That seems more like
a magical drug than a spice.

11:04.100 --> 11:06.720
Hey, haven't we met before?

11:08.310 --> 11:13.610
Why no, I've just come here to publicize this spice for the manufacturers.

11:13.610 --> 11:16.990
I'm taking this Zero-Calorie Campaign
to every school in the nation.

11:16.990 --> 11:19.240
Give me some of that spice too!

11:19.240 --> 11:21.240
Me too, me too!

11:21.240 --> 11:23.490
If you'll excuse me,
I must be going...

11:45.520 --> 11:47.560
It feels so strange...

11:49.110 --> 11:53.490
There's a soft orange light spreading through my heart from the raspberries.

11:53.490 --> 11:56.400
As if the coldness and darkness
were melting away

11:56.400 --> 11:58.150
What are you doing, Vanilla?

12:00.530 --> 12:02.120
I'm not doing anything.

12:02.120 --> 12:05.500
Why don't you help pass out some
Void Spice at the school?

12:05.500 --> 12:07.620
You'll be collecting some
Noir this afternoon.

12:08.630 --> 12:12.090
Wishing to eat and eat
without getting fat...

12:12.090 --> 12:14.880
means eating and eating
without ever being satisfied.

12:14.880 --> 12:18.380
Humans are such foolish,
fleeting creatures.

12:18.380 --> 12:22.970
Indeed, this spice will nourish
the darkness in their hearts,

12:22.970 --> 12:24.890
and give birth to Noir.

12:41.700 --> 12:45.160
Did Vahilla get mad and go home?

12:48.670 --> 12:52.460
All right, we'll be starting
afternoon classes now.

12:56.510 --> 12:58.760
What's wrong, Natsume?

12:58.760 --> 13:02.010
There's no point in studying.

13:02.010 --> 13:04.020
I've got no motivation at all.

13:05.100 --> 13:09.980
Children, please take your
seats so we can start class!

13:09.980 --> 13:12.770
We are in our seats.

13:14.890 --> 13:18.230
And just who is
throwing balls in my class?

13:18.700 --> 13:21.870
That'd be me. Sorry 'bout that.

13:24.990 --> 13:26.580
Wha?

13:27.170 --> 13:28.740
Hey, Mimura-kun?

13:33.090 --> 13:34.510
See ya, suckers!

13:34.510 --> 13:35.370
Mimura?!

13:36.340 --> 13:39.010
I'm so bored I just have to leave.

13:39.010 --> 13:40.130
We agree.

13:41.140 --> 13:42.810
Me too.

13:42.810 --> 13:44.100
Same here.

13:44.100 --> 13:45.130
I'm outta here.

13:45.640 --> 13:49.400
Guys, we're still in class!

13:50.400 --> 13:52.390
What has become of this class??

13:58.490 --> 14:01.240
Gee, what's next?

14:06.080 --> 14:08.580
What're you doing, Akira?

14:09.630 --> 14:11.840
You're just now eating lunch?

14:11.840 --> 14:14.920
Yeah. I was too busy
at the newspaper to eat.

14:15.420 --> 14:19.580
Akira and I are totally normal.
How bizarre.

14:22.260 --> 14:24.350
That spice from earlier...

14:25.220 --> 14:26.640
This is bad!

14:27.730 --> 14:29.560
What happened, Kato?

14:30.810 --> 14:32.190
Huh?

14:32.190 --> 14:33.690
What's going on?

14:33.690 --> 14:35.600
Where'd everybody go?

14:38.110 --> 14:39.100
I was right...

14:39.740 --> 14:43.610
All the kids who used that
spice have gone nuts.

14:44.580 --> 14:46.660
Wait, don't tell me...

14:48.000 --> 14:51.570
Noir hearts... so many Noir hearts...!

15:01.720 --> 15:04.600
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

15:10.360 --> 15:12.590
Noir, gather to me!

15:18.820 --> 15:20.700
Someone's collecting the Noir!

15:23.620 --> 15:25.840
They're going that way!

15:29.790 --> 15:33.670
That warm light
from before has vanished...

15:34.610 --> 15:38.750
It's been replaced by a dark,
cold orb within me.

15:42.430 --> 15:44.600
Wha? What am I doing here?

15:44.600 --> 15:46.600
Shouldn't we be in class?

15:46.600 --> 15:48.560
Why am I carrying this ball?

15:52.660 --> 15:54.180
Vanilla!

15:57.780 --> 16:00.160
Vanilla...

16:00.160 --> 16:01.450
It can't be...

16:03.620 --> 16:04.940
Wait, Vanilla!

16:19.590 --> 16:21.500
Pierre...

16:34.650 --> 16:37.780
Pierre's making Vanilla collect Noir?

16:38.280 --> 16:39.900
Probably.

16:40.360 --> 16:43.200
And that shady salesman
used the spice...

16:43.200 --> 16:45.850
to make everyone's hearts that way.

16:46.450 --> 16:48.200
I've gotta do something about it!

16:48.200 --> 16:51.400
But Robin-sensei told us to
stay away from the Ogres.

16:51.790 --> 16:53.960
That's right! And Robin also said...

16:53.960 --> 16:56.920
that the Queen Selection
Exam would continue.

16:57.920 --> 17:02.290
Your mission is to collect ecure from
hearts, and become Queen!

17:02.720 --> 17:05.560
It's all right. I'll stay faaar
away from the Ogres.

17:05.560 --> 17:06.080
Ribbit?

17:06.080 --> 17:08.270
So what will you do?

17:08.270 --> 17:11.810
I'll steal the spice
and dump it somewhere.

17:11.810 --> 17:15.610
At this rate, they'll keep on turning
more people's hearts Noir.

17:15.610 --> 17:19.150
It'll be the same tomorrow
and every day after that.

17:20.200 --> 17:22.600
If we don't act, Vanilla will...

17:23.070 --> 17:24.740
Chocolat...

17:24.740 --> 17:26.350
Sounds fun.

17:26.350 --> 17:28.370
Let's do it!

17:28.370 --> 17:29.120
Saule...

17:30.290 --> 17:33.030
All right! We haven't played
"Band of Thieves" in ages!

17:37.130 --> 17:39.970
Hey! Get back here!!

17:44.180 --> 17:49.390
Man, it's so exciting to be at school when it's dark and no one's around!

17:50.140 --> 17:51.850
Hey now!

17:57.820 --> 18:00.860
Saule just can't control himself.

18:02.700 --> 18:04.390
Chocolat...

18:07.160 --> 18:09.660
Just tell me one thing.

18:10.790 --> 18:14.110
You're worried about the Ogres in
general, not just Pierre, right?

18:14.630 --> 18:16.250
Yeah.

18:16.250 --> 18:19.090
And this person Robin-sensei
said you were in love with...

18:19.090 --> 18:22.370
Please tell me it isn't Pierre.

18:22.370 --> 18:26.120
W-what're you saying?
There's no way that could be right!

18:28.270 --> 18:31.100
I'd rather be wrong than right.

18:31.100 --> 18:32.640
Sorry.

18:32.640 --> 18:36.110
Why is Houx...

18:36.110 --> 18:37.630
It's just...

18:38.320 --> 18:40.690
if it were true,

18:42.820 --> 18:44.100
I would...

18:50.450 --> 18:52.830
This is awesome!

18:54.130 --> 18:57.300
No, it's nothing.
Let's look for the spice.

18:57.300 --> 18:58.210
Yeah.

18:58.210 --> 19:01.170
It doesn't seem to be around here,
so let's check the kitchen.

19:01.170 --> 19:02.870
Worth a shot.

19:06.810 --> 19:08.600
It won't open...

19:11.940 --> 19:13.390
Chocolat!

19:14.310 --> 19:16.670
This must be the work of the Ogres!

19:17.190 --> 19:18.730
Show yourself!

19:19.530 --> 19:24.140
What did you think... of my spice?

19:24.140 --> 19:26.950
So you were the salesman
I "met" this afternoon!

19:26.950 --> 19:31.710
It's my duty to use this spice to make Noir hearts for Vanilla-sama.

19:31.710 --> 19:32.940
One of Pierre's associates?

19:32.940 --> 19:34.980
I will not let you interfere.

19:35.380 --> 19:36.920
Same to you!

19:36.920 --> 19:39.610
We won't let you
turn people's hearts into Noir!

19:40.090 --> 19:43.630
Then let's get started! Rafale!

19:44.830 --> 19:49.430
My name is Juiliet,
and I control the wind.

19:49.430 --> 19:52.520
This wind is so strong
I can barely breathe...

19:53.940 --> 19:55.940
Are you okay, Chocolat?

19:58.690 --> 19:59.550
Houx...

19:59.980 --> 20:05.320
This wind will react to your movements and paralyze your respiration.

20:07.200 --> 20:09.780
Gee, I'd love to experience that.

20:10.830 --> 20:13.290
Mur de Lierre!

20:18.130 --> 20:19.500
The wind stopped...

20:21.010 --> 20:22.130
Do it now, Chocolat!

20:23.470 --> 20:26.410
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

20:27.180 --> 20:29.140
Brille Etoile!

20:31.310 --> 20:35.050
You who are born
from Darkness, disappear!

20:39.820 --> 20:42.740
No, it burns...!

20:45.950 --> 20:48.740
What the hell? I didn't think
he'd be this weak.

20:48.740 --> 20:50.030
You did it, Saule!

20:51.620 --> 20:53.870
And thank you
for protecting me, Houx!

20:59.340 --> 21:03.110
So Vanilla really was collecting
all those Noir today.

21:03.110 --> 21:07.680
Vanilla's so gentle, that if she keeps
gathering this many Noir...

21:08.600 --> 21:10.890
Excellent work, Vanilla-sama.

21:11.350 --> 21:13.730
You brought in so many Noir.

21:13.730 --> 21:16.650
Even Pierre-sama himself
can't take that many.

21:19.070 --> 21:20.400
Get out.

21:20.400 --> 21:21.090
But...

21:21.090 --> 21:22.690
Just leave me alone!

21:25.660 --> 21:26.910
Why is it...

21:27.490 --> 21:30.120
My chest is burning hot,

21:30.120 --> 21:32.520
and my throat's so dry
that I can't breathe.

21:37.540 --> 21:40.420
Oh yeah... the raspberries...

21:47.300 --> 21:48.260
Why...

21:48.930 --> 21:51.350
Why am I feeling like this?

21:51.970 --> 21:54.270
There's no need to worry, Vanilla.

21:55.850 --> 21:56.620
Pierre...

21:56.980 --> 21:58.980
The pain you're feeling is...

21:58.980 --> 22:01.650
a side effect of
having Noir inside you.

22:01.650 --> 22:06.200
The purity of your original heart
must be resisting the Noir.

22:06.860 --> 22:11.740
But soon, it will fall
into a deep, dark sleep.

22:11.740 --> 22:14.410
Just like mine did.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

